<div class="container page-section">
  <div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow blue">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><h1>안녕하세요,<br><%= h(@profile['display_name']) %>입니다<span class="blue-dot">.</span></h1></div>
  <div class="about-grid"><div class="prose about-prose"><p class="lead"><%= h(@profile['intro']) %></p><%= paragraphs(@profile['bio']) %><div class="about-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact">이야기 나누기 <%= icon('arrow') %></a><% if (resume = public_resume) %><a class="button secondary" href="/files/<%= h(resume['id']) %>/download">이력서 다운로드 <%= icon('download') %></a><% end %></div></div><aside class="about-card"><div class="monogram">d<span>.</span></div><h2><%= h(@profile['display_name']) %></h2><p class="muted"><%= h(@profile['role']) %></p><% unless @profile['location'].empty? %><div class="location"><%= icon('pin') %><%= h(@profile['location']) %></div><% end %><div class="about-links"><% unless @profile['github_url'].empty? %><a href="<%= h(@profile['github_url']) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <%= icon('external') %></a><% end %><% unless @profile['blog_url'].empty? %><a href="<%= h(@profile['blog_url']) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Blog <%= icon('external') %></a><% end %></div></aside></div>
  <section class="about-skills"><div class="eyebrow blue">TOOLS & INTERESTS</div><h2>사용하는 도구와 관심 분야</h2><div class="skill-list"><% skills.each_with_index do |skill, i| %><div><span class="mono"><%= format('%02d', i + 1) %></span><strong><%= h(skill) %></strong><%= icon('code') %></div><% end %></div></section>
</div>
